BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 301.77 Tm (The first trap is margin blindness. Rafael Hernandez spells out the math: if a buyer pays $30 per lead and ad spend) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 286.55 Tm (produces it at $40, the agency is negative $10 on every lead it ships, so spend and sale price have to be tracked daily,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 271.32 Tm (weekly and monthly [ngsR38BAFbc @ 00:06:33]. Rafael also watched beginners burn $1,000 to $2,000 on ads to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.10 Tm ('figure out' pricing and end up holding leads with no home [ngsR38BAFbc @ 00:05:25]. Smart Capital runs the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.87 Tm (check on the client side: a dentist earning $800 per new patient, charged $250 per booked appointment and closing one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.65 Tm (in three, pays $750 to win $800, which is too tight, while one in two drops acquisition to $500 [ozWkxUTBug4 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 210.42 Tm (00:05:28]. Smart Capital's broader rule: run the client's numbers before quoting your own. reachmarketingllc pushes the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 195.20 Tm (arithmetic upstream: start from a $6,000 allowable acquisition cost, strip non-media costs to $4,000, apply a 5% close) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.97 Tm (rate for a $200 maximum cost per lead, then a 4% landing page conversion rate for an $8 cost-per-click ceiling that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 164.75 Tm (must never be treated as a suggested bid [M0v6X1EjkRM @ 00:02:28]. Paying above that ceiling demands a higher) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 149.52 Tm (page conversion rate, a higher close rate, or accepting a loss on the customer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 134.30 Tm (The second failure is slow contact and leaky follow-up. Nato Guajardo says 10 years of agency data show that reaching) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 119.07 Tm (a lead by phone, text or chatbot within 1 to 5 minutes lifts conversion 400 to 1,000%, which is why the whole stack) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 103.85 Tm (round-robins leads and auto-calls the salesperson with a live transfer [VSivqJQ89ow @ 00:19:21]. Even with that, Nato) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 88.62 Tm (expects to close only 20 to 30% of paid leads, so unsold leads get nurtured 6 to 12 months and dropped back into the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 73.40 Tm (pipeline for re-quoting [VSivqJQ89ow @ 00:22:46]. Max Conversion's Kyle tells truck insurance agencies to run) Tj ET
