BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 262.30 Tm (a sending inbox.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 247.07 Tm (Credit burn is the second recurring loss, and it hits from several directions. Cassata warns that a waterfall provider can) Tj ET
