BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 445.77 Tm (The roofing failures practitioners report most often are financial leaks nobody measured. Adam Bensman describes one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 430.55 Tm (roofer spending $30,000 to $35,000 a month with no trackable results, and another burning about $600,000 a year with) Tj ET
