BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 293.52 Tm (00:01:57].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 278.30 Tm (On the build side, the failure modes are speed, niche choice and Google penalties. Ippei names the biggest mistake) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.07 Tm (outright: 'not building sites fast enough' [wU1OKeR3fvI @ 00:01:36]. His niche autopsy lists foundation repair in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 247.85 Tm (30,000-person city as a mistake, roofing and Miami lawn care as too competitive, garage door as too GBP-dependent,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 232.62 Tm (and house cleaning as too low-ticket against TaskRabbit. He also warns that scaled content abuse can hit across) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 217.40 Tm (multiple sites at once, that stock photos and bloated page counts hurt, and that location pages need unique content) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 202.17 Tm ([0G_j4pX14MI @ 00:11:28]. Core updates land three to four times a year, and the wrong backlinks damage rankings.) Tj ET
