BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (each, against $500 to $1,500 per TCPA violation [tRO0J70WjKA @ 00:13:43]. DatatoLeads counters that individual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (operators are "not on the radar." In its view, the real exposure scales with a call center running 1,000 agents at 200 calls) Tj ET
