BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.20 Tm (refunds about a hundred different ways, and the fix they built is a cap, for example refunds capped at 15% over the past) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 403.97 Tm (30 days, with CSV bulk approval for the rest [yCAVYNpSdZI @ 00:22:50]. Lead QC closes the front door: junk like) Tj ET
